### POST /api/event/archive/:id* [message] · GET /api/event/single-event-for-form/:id* [message]
### GET /api/event/redeem/get-business [message] · POST /api/event/verify [message]
### GET /api/event/verify/:id [message] · POST /api/event/verify/manual [message]
### GET /api/event/ticket/purchase?eventId= [message] · POST /api/event/ticket/purchase/:id/send-invoice [message]
### POST|GET /api/deals [error] · PATCH /api/deals/edit/:id [error] · POST /api/deals/delete/:id [error]
### POST /api/deals/verify [message] · GET /api/deals/redeem/single/:id [message]
### POST|GET /api/services [error] · GET|POST|DELETE* /api/services/single/:id [error]
### POST /api/services/assign-employee [error] · GET|POST /api/categories [error]
### GET|PATCH|DELETE /api/categories/:id [error] · POST|GET /api/employees [error]
### GET|POST|DELETE /api/employees/:id [error] · PATCH /api/employees/:id/schedule [error]
### GET|POST /api/employees/time-off [error] · DELETE /api/employees/time-off/:id [error]
### GET|POST /api/employees/shift-overrides [error] · DELETE /api/employees/shift-overrides/:id [error]
### PATCH /api/resources/:id/schedule [error] · GET|POST|DELETE /api/resources/overrides [error]
### GET /api/bookings [message; web 401 body {success:false,code:"UNAUTHORIZED",message:"You must be logged in"}]
### PATCH /api/bookings/:id [error] · PATCH /api/bookings/status [error] · GET /api/bookings/today [error]
### GET /api/calendar/bookings [error] · POST /api/calendar/appointments [error]
### Unchanged on purpose: POST /api/bookings (consumer booking), POST /api/event/ticket/purchase
### (consumer/guest), /api/event/delete/:id (disabled server-side: always 500 "cannot delete").
